acceptance:
docs/host-checklist.md and docs/features/cli-and-mcp.md state, as a contract a host can build a trigger on:
- the capture and transport deadlines of `engram backup push` and their defaults;
- the flags that set them;
- what happens at each deadline: which work stops, what is left pending, and the exit code;
- how a host cancels a running push, and what a cancelled push leaves behind and how the next push resolves it.
A test covers each stated cancellation and deadline outcome that is not already covered.
